            "description": "Watch Forward Madison vs Union Omaha highlights and goals from USL Championship on ReFooty: Football Highlights Hub. Match played on July 12, 2026. Fans in attendance for this USL Championship clash witnessed a rollercoaster of emotions in a duel that tested the resolve of both sides. The fixture, held on July 12, 2026 , promised to be a competitive affair, but the drama that unfolded in the closing stages defied all expectations. Madison Assumes Control The match entered its decisive phase with Forward Madison seemingly in total command of the proceedings. In the 63rd minute, the home side's confidence was bolstered when R. Carmichael found the back of the net to stretch the lead to 3-1. It appeared to be a comfortable cushion, leaving Union Omaha with a mountain to climb if they were to take anything from the game. However, the visitors refused to surrender. Union Omaha launched a spirited comeback late in the second half, starting in the 79th minute when S. Ors scored to make it 3-2. The momentum shifted rapidly, and just four minutes later, the referee pointed to the spot. D. Gutierrez stepped up to take the penalty in the 83rd minute and calmly converted, remarkably bringing the score level at 3-3. Stoppage-Time Salvation With the clock ticking deep into injury time, the match looked destined to end in a hard-fought draw. But there was one final twist in this high-scoring football spectacle. In the 96th minute (90+6'), H. Karamoko popped up to score a sensational winner for Forward Madison . The goal secured a 4-3 victory in the dying seconds, providing a breathtaking conclusion to an extraordinary afternoon of sports action."
